These evidence can be summed as under :
a. Entries-1,14 &47 is the valuation of the house and that under construction;
b. Entries- 2 to 3,44-47 are certified copies of registered sale deed of plots of land;
c. Entries -4 to 7, are cash memos of arms purchased; d. Entries- 8 to 10, 11 to 13,
15-32,35-40,47-48 are statement of account/pass books of bank deposits;
e. Entries 33-34 are invoice of vehicles purchased; f. Entries-41-42 are NSC/KVP 28.
